msgid "On the GP-150 / GP-180, enable Bluetooth and configure MIDI IN Source as BT Only or Mixed. Configure the pedal’s MIDI-capable EXP/FS jack for MIDI OUT and connect the correct TRS MIDI cable to the downstream pedal. Match MIDI channels on the pedals. Forwarding Bluetooth input to physical MIDI OUT depends on the GP-150 / GP-180’s routing and firmware; use the test command to verify it. A Bluetooth connection alone does not confirm delivery at MIDI OUT."
